  "description": "<p data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3842\"><strong data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3842\">Panasonic NV-S1E VHS-C camcorder – werkend + accessoires</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"4074\">Breng nostalgie tot leven met deze klassieke <strong data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3925\">Panasonic NV-S1E VHS-C camcorder</strong>, geleverd in werkende staat en met diverse originele accessoires. Perfect voor liefhebbers, verzamelaars of wie oude VHS-C banden wil digitaliseren.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4117\"><strong data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4117\">Belangrijkste kenmerken & pluspunten:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4509\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4220\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4220\">Authentieke analoge opname in VHS-C formaat, ideaal voor retrogebruik of overdracht naar digitaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4315\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4315\">Compleet geleverd: batterij, lader, AV-kabel, draagriem, mogelijk adapter voor VHS-formaat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4394\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4394\">Compact en robuust design uit de jaren ’90 — een stukje camerageschiedenis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4395\" data-end=\"4475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4475\">Mogelijkheid om oude familievideo’s opnieuw af te spelen of te digitaliseren</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4509\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4509\">Eén maand garantie inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4547\"><strong data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4545\">Specificaties in één oogopslag</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4961\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4565\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4565\">\r\n<th data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Aspect</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4565\" data-col-size=\"md\">Info</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4961\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4612\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Model</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4584\" data-end=\"4612\" data-col-size=\"md\">Panasonic NV-S1E (VHS-C)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4613\" data-end=\"4666\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4613\" data-end=\"4628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sensor / pix</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4628\" data-end=\"4666\">Ca. 1/3\" CCD, circa 320.000 pixels</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4667\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4667\" data-end=\"4674\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zoom</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4708\">6× motorzoom met macro-functie</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4763\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4725\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sluitertijden</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4763\" data-col-size=\"md\">Variërend van 1/120 tot 1/4000 sec</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4764\" data-end=\"4797\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4764\" data-end=\"4784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lichtgevoeligheid</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4784\" data-end=\"4797\">Ca. 5 lux</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4879\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4812\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Accessoires</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4812\" data-end=\"4879\" data-col-size=\"md\">Battery, lader, AV-kabels, draagriem, adapter (indien aanwezig)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4961\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4891\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Features</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4891\" data-end=\"4961\" data-col-size=\"md\">Datum/tijd overlay, fade in/out, automatische en manuele bediening</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4963\" data-end=\"5085\">Of je nu de esthetiek waardeert of echte videomateriaal wilt behouden — deze camcorder biedt beide in één charmant pakket.</p>",
